## Troubleshooting

### Wrong URL/Missing Page
- Confirm Apache is running in XAMPP (green status, not red)
- Check file paths match your OS (Windows uses \, Linux/macOS uses /)
- Ensure file extension is exactly `.html` and `.php`

### 403 Forbidden Error (Permission Denied)
- On Windows: Right-click XAMPP → Properties → Security → Ensure EVERYONE has Full Control (or your user account)
- On macOS/Linux: chmod 755 /path/to/security_lab

### 404 Not Found Error
- Confirm file names are exactly `phishing_demo.html`, `capture_credentials.php`
- Check you're on the correct subdirectory in XAMPP

### PHP Not Running (raw code displays)
- Ensure PHP is enabled in XAMPP config
- Check `httpd.conf` has `LoadModule PHP7_Loader_module modules/php7/libphp.so` (Windows format varies)
- Restart Apache after config changes

### Log File Not Updating
- Check PHP file is executable (rename to .php)
- Verify Apache can write to the directory
- Review the path in `capture_credentials.php` matches your directory

