OCR0A = desired_us;          // 8-bit timer: 1-255µs = 3µs granularity
```

### 5. Piezo Signal Noise Filtering Debounce Bugs
Pitfall: Missing hardware pre-filter, relies entirely on software debounce:
```c
int8_t trigger_count = 0;
if (piezo_high && (count++ > INTERRUPT_WINDOW)) {
}  // Problem: PIEZO spikes can be 1µs, debounce needs to sample them
```
